msgid "Developer Tools"
msgstr "开发者工具"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:33 0864c90022004e34acfde4eda37ca3c4
msgid ""
"FlytOS provides several developer tools, such as FlytSDK and FlytSIM, to "
"further help developers quickly get started."
msgstr "FlytOS 提供多种开发者工具，如 FlytSDK 和 FlytSIM，进一步帮助开发人员快速上手。"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:35 dfef041bb92141efa415ed5df2e94f52
msgid ""
"`FlytSDK "
"<http://docs.flytbase.com/docs/FlytOS/Developers/BuildingCustomApps.html#remote-"
"apps>`__ is the software development kit for web and android developers. A "
"number of `sample applications <https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples>`__ "
"are available on github, that can be used as templates/reference to build "
"custom applications."
msgstr ""
"`FlytSDK "
"<http://docs.flytbase.com/docs/FlytOS/Developers/BuildingCustomApps.html#remote-"
"apps>`__ 是面向 Web 和 Android 开发人员的软件开发套件。GitHub 上提供了大量 `示例应用程序 "
"<https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples>`__，可用作构建自定义应用程序的模板/参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:37 9f2dc4d61d0a42e18d12b9364e0d7378
msgid ""
"`FlytSIM <http://docs.flytbase.com/docs/FlytOS/Developers/Flytsim.html>`__ "
"is a ROS/Gazebo based simulator to test applications built using FlytAPIs. "
"This allows developers to build and test drone applications, safely and "
"efficiently, minimizing the requirement for flight-tests."
msgstr ""
"`FlytSIM <http://docs.flytbase.com/docs/FlytOS/Developers/Flytsim.html>`__ "
"是基于 ROS/Gazebo 的仿真器，用于测试使用 FlytAPI "
"构建的应用程序。这使开发人员能够安全高效地构建和测试无人机应用程序，最大限度地减少飞行测试需求。"

