#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:72 37cb6b08b72c4389822c0dc1efed6937
msgid "Remote APIs"
msgstr "远程 API"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:74 9b3c92823c3b47a5b7017bf857d0bce9
msgid ""
"These are APIs for building web/mobile apps for remote devices and are "
"helpful for creating custom User Interfaces specific to the application as "
"well as for integrating any off-board processing. They are available as "
"`RESTful <http://api.flytbase.com/?javascript--REST#introduction>`__ and "
"`WebSocket <http://api.flytbase.com/?javascript--Websocket#introduction>`__ "
"requests, where typically REST is used for sending commands to the drone and"
" WebSocket for getting continual data stream (telemetry). Click one of the "
"below links, to know more about building custom apps for web and mobile."
msgstr ""
"这些是用于为远程设备构建 Web/移动应用程序的 API，有助于为特定应用程序创建自定义用户界面以及集成任何离线处理。它们以 `RESTful "
"<http://api.flytbase.com/?javascript--REST#introduction>`__ 和 `WebSocket "
"<http://api.flytbase.com/?javascript--Websocket#introduction>`__ 请求的形式提供，通常 "
"REST 用于向无人机发送命令，WebSocket 用于获取连续数据流（数传数据）。点击以下链接之一，了解更多关于构建 Web "
"和移动自定义应用程序的信息。"

