#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:80 38d31369e7ff489788094c523eca2755
msgid "Sample Applications"
msgstr "示例应用程序"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:82 5f520bd01ef24f89afe154790cabdd67
msgid ""
"We have made available, a few sample apps to help you get started with drone"
" application development. You can find them on github at `FlytSamples github"
" repository <https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples>`__. These sample apps "
"are written in all of the above :ref:`supported languages "
"<supported_languages>`. Web/android developers could begin with a simple "
"`Joystick App <https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples/tree/master/Mobile-"
"Apps/Java-Apps/Joystick>`__. A couple of easy-to-understand `CPP/Python/ROS "
"based apps <https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples/tree/master/CPP-Python-"
"ROS-Apps>`__ are also available."
msgstr ""
"我们提供了一些示例应用程序，帮助您开始无人机应用程序开发。您可以在 GitHub 的 `FlytSamples 仓库 "
"<https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples>`__ 中找到它们。这些示例应用程序使用上述所有 "
":ref:`支持的语言 <supported_languages>` 编写。Web/Android 开发人员可以从简单的 `摇杆应用 "
"<https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples/tree/master/Mobile-Apps/Java-"
"Apps/Joystick>`__ 开始。还提供了几个易于理解的 `基于 CPP/Python/ROS 的应用程序 "
"<https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples/tree/master/CPP-Python-ROS-"
"Apps>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:85 dd15b3dc13c746059407f68e30a2e0b0
msgid "Vision-based Object-Tracking and Following"
msgstr "基于视觉的目标跟踪与跟随"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:87 d1809ca17d9b41b6a0e375d4e087be1b
msgid ""
"FlytOS comes bundled with Vision-based Object-Tracking and Following module."
" To learn more about it, checkout `this blog "
"<http://blogs.flytbase.com/computer-vision-for-drones-part-2/>`__."
msgstr ""
"FlytOS 内置了基于视觉的目标跟踪与跟随模块。要了解更多信息，请查看 `这篇博文 "
"<http://blogs.flytbase.com/computer-vision-for-drones-part-2/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:95 2a8ba86385594491a9fc1eaa0bc03ff5
msgid "Deep Learning with Nvidia"
msgstr "使用 Nvidia 进行深度学习"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:97 0fab11230b5b4c898a557ac04bbc605b
msgid ""
"Using FlytOS on Nvidia-TX1/Nvidia-TX2 opens up possible integration of deep "
"learning applications with drone. To begin with, you could install *caffe*, "
"a popular deep learning framework by following our `deep learning tutorial "
"<https://goo.gl/HwNMuY>`__. We also have a sample `object classification and"
" tracking <https://github.com/flytbase/flytos_tx1>`__ example using caffe. "
"`Read more <https://goo.gl/ZReoJ7>`__."
msgstr ""
"在 Nvidia-TX1/Nvidia-TX2 上使用 FlytOS 为无人机集成深度学习应用提供了可能。首先，您可以按照我们的 `深度学习教程 "
"<https://goo.gl/HwNMuY>`__ 安装流行的深度学习框架 *caffe*。我们还提供了一个使用 caffe 的 `目标分类与跟踪 "
"<https://github.com/flytbase/flytos_tx1>`__ 示例。`了解更多 "
"<https://goo.gl/ZReoJ7>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:105 133c43913f0f48069837e80f3eea1167
msgid "GPS based Object Following"
msgstr "基于 GPS 的目标跟随"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:107 ed3d542bef84455fa2f2a7776bbde976
msgid ""
"This android app would enable you to control your drone to follow you "
"wherever you go based on your device's GPS location. Take a look at the `GPS"
" Follow Me code <https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples/tree/master/Mobile-"
"Apps/Java-Apps/Follow_me>`__, install it in your mobile and see FlytOS in "
"action."
msgstr ""
"这款 Android 应用程序可让您根据设备的 GPS 位置控制无人机跟随您行动。查看 `GPS 跟我飞代码 "
"<https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples/tree/master/Mobile-Apps/Java-"
"Apps/Follow_me>`__，将其安装到手机上，看看 FlytOS 的实际效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:111 f4fc36dab18046569c4166e0c2d5772f
msgid "SONAR based obstacle detection"
msgstr "基于声纳的障碍物检测"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:113 aa9bfbc59e3b43169c37884a6c1347b0
msgid ""
"You could enable your drone with a minimalistic obstacle detection by using "
"SONAR, capturing its data, integrating it with FlytOS and eventually "
"maneuvering the drone through an obstacle course. We have provided a `sample"
" implementation <https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples/tree/master/Sample-"
"Projects/sonar_obstacle_sensor>`__, of using Arduino to trigger SONAR and "
"then transmit the captured data to a companion computer. Using this data, "
"you could write a simple onboard ROS/cpp/python app navigating the drone "
"using FlytAPIs."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过使用声纳、采集数据、与 FlytOS 集成并最终操纵无人机穿越障碍物，为无人机提供简约的障碍物检测功能。我们提供了一个使用 Arduino "
"触发声纳并将采集数据传输到伴飞计算机的 `示例实现 "
"<https://github.com/flytbase/flytsamples/tree/master/Sample-"
"Projects/sonar_obstacle_sensor>`__。使用这些数据，您可以编写一个简单的机载 ROS/cpp/python "
"应用程序，通过 FlytAPI 导航无人机。"

